SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS Vinyasa Flow\, NCMA
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**Memorial Day Weekend.** Join us for 
 a vinyasa flow to yin practice ending in savasana. Join our community and 
 meet other like-minded people! Yoga heals. Nature heals. Yoga In Nature™
 .\n\nBEGINNERS WELCOME AND MODIFICATIONS PROVIDED.\n\nPractice vinyasa flo
 w to yin yoga at North Carolina Museum of Art\, outdoors near upper parkin
 g area in grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS GRASS LOCATION\, as there are other 
 groups that use NCMA grounds). WHEN YOU COME INTO THE PARKING LOT\, DRIVE 
 TO WHERE THE TWO PARKING LOTS ON BLUE RIDGE MEET\, AWAY FROM THE MUSEUM. W
 e practice in the grass Ellipse area:)\n$15/person\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-G
 enander (0862)\nPaypal dgenander@yogainnature.com\nZelle\n\nCome flow with
  us. Meet others and make friends in our yoga community.\nBring a mat or t
 owel for the ground\; water\; sunscreen\; and anything else you may need f
 or your outdoor yoga practice. You may also want a plastic liner for under
  your mat\, if the grass is damp.\nALL LEVELS WELCOME.
