SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, SUP Yoga\, Falls Lake
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n***NEW SEASON LAUNCH...JOIN US FOR SUP
  YOGA (stand-up paddle board yoga) .*** **Payment is due at time of sign-u
 p**\, in order to hold your spot. At least 4 attendees to run this class. 
 **$35/person** **(MEMORIAL DAY WEEKEND SUP YOGA LAUNCH SPECIAL)** includes
  basic paddle instruction\, yoga class on SUP\, anchors (to borrow for cla
 ss)\, and summertime snacks. *YOU WILL BE REIMBURSED IF IT RAINS and/or if
  I need to cancel.* *If you sign up and can’t make it\, you will receive
  a one time credit for a future SUP Yoga class to use this season.*\nCerti
 fied SUP yoga instructor to lead you in yoga\, on the water:)\nGrab your S
 tandup Paddle Board and meet us at Falls Lake.\nI have one board for rent\
 , first come first serve ($25).I have also researched place(s) where you a
 re able to rent a SUP board. You would be responsible for picking up and t
 hen returning the board to the location. Recommendation to rent for 3-4 ho
 urs\, as you will need time to pick it up\, use for the 1.5 hour class the
 n return it. I will have anchors to borrow\, upon request.\nRentals at htt
 ps://wakerack.com/\n\nWe will meet at the beach area and begin with basic 
 instruction of the paddle strokes\, board\, etc. If you have already done 
 SUP\, you can get out on the water\, and we will meet you there after 15 m
 inutes of intro. We will paddle out to one of the coves (15 - 20 minutes) 
 then anchor down for about a 60 minute SUP yoga class. Then\, we will padd
 le back in unless you choose to remain on the water to explore. IF YOU HAV
 E A NEW BOARD THIS SEASON\, PLEASE TAKE TIME TO INFLATE IT AT HOME TO MAKE
  SURE THERE ARE NO SLOW LEAKS (PRIOR TO GETTING ON THE WATER). FAMILIARIZE
  YOURSELF WITH YOUR EQUIPMENT AT THE START OF THE SEASON AND VE READY TO I
 NFLATE YOUR OWN BOARD WITH YOUR PUMP. THE GROUP THANKS YOU IN ADVANCE:)\n\
 nNOTE: There is an entrance fee for this location at Falls Lake. I believe
  it is $10 per car. Feel free to verify.\n\nPlease bring your board\; padd
 le\; anchor (OR I have anchors to lend out)\; water bottle\; sunscreen\, e
 tc\; ***Good Pops will be provided\, but feel free to bring your own snack
  to enjoy before or after class:)***\n\nALL Levels welcome. $35 pay in adv
 ance by Venmo @Darlene-Genander (0862 last 4 digits of phone if asked) or 
 PayPal at dgenander@yogainnature.com to hold your spot.\nAlso accepting Ze
 lle.
